OL,3,GNEWSAFree Christmas promenade parking  
OL,4,Areturns                                
OL,6,FThe start of free parking in Douglas   
OL,7,FCity Centre begins later ahead of the  
OL,8,Ffestive season.                        
OL,10,FFrom Thursday, motorists will be       
OL,11,Fallowed two hour disc parking on       
OL,12,FDouglas Promenade.                     
OL,14,FIt will be available until 13 January  
OL,15,F2027.                                  
OL,17,FPeople will also be able to park their 
OL,18,Fcars at Shaws Brow Car Park for free   
OL,19,Fevery weekend from 19:00 Friday until  
OL,20,F07:00 on Monday.                       
